# SekolahRapi Environment Variables

## Supabase
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_...
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=sb_secret_...

## App
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=SekolahRapi
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://sekolah-rapi.vercel.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_POWERED_BY=Arblok Digital

## Cron (opsional tapi disarankan — isi di Vercel agar /api/cron aman)
CRON_SECRET=

## Gemini AI (chat "Tanya Arblok") — isi di .env.local & Vercel, jangan commit nilainya
GEMINI_API_KEY=

## OpenRouter (fallback Tanya Arblok saat Gemini sibuk / model gonta-ganti)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
OPENROUTER_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
